+## Storage Model
 
-The selected concurrency policy will define the remaining submission metadata and review operations. They are deliberately not specified yet.
+| Store | Contents |
+|---|---|
+| visits | visit ID, current revision ID, plot ID, first submission's schema version |
+| revisions | revision ID, visit ID, base revision ID, payload, schema version, author ID, idempotency key, server receipt time, status |
+| resolutions | resolution ID, visit ID, coordinator ID, resolution time, selected revision ID or null, contributing revision IDs with outcomes, previous and resulting current revision IDs |
